From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yodaliu <yodaliu@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:03:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Revert "Qseecom: Add qseecom_32bit_impl driver to make
 qseecom compatible with 32 bit target."

This reverts commit b5f2395e174c0780793d625794f682b2e1fe6c7a.

The stock FW 1.1.0 qseecom_dlkm is built without this driver (no 32-bit ioctl
conversion, plain copy_from_user/copy_to_user).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 Kbuild                       |   3 -
 qseecom/qseecom.c            | 162 +++---
 qseecom/qseecom_32bit_impl.c | 943 -----------------------------------
 qseecom/qseecom_32bit_impl.h | 341 -------------
 4 files changed, 68 insertions(+), 1381 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 qseecom/qseecom_32bit_impl.c
 delete mode 100644 qseecom/qseecom_32bit_impl.h

